    {
      "id": "49e5d8b846a7-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Where is sodium located on the periodic table? &#2310;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Where is sodium located on the periodic table?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2310;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Bottom of the table &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Bottom of the table</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Top period &#2358;&#2368;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2310;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Top period</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2358;&#2368;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2310;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "On the right side &#2342;&#2366;&#2312;&#2306; &#2323;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">On the right side</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2366;&#2312;&#2306; &#2323;&#2352;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "On the left side &#2348;&#2366;&#2312;&#2306; &#2323;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">On the left side</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2366;&#2312;&#2306; &#2323;&#2352;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><b>The metals are to the left of the line (except for hydrogen, which is a nonmetal)</b>, the nonmetals are to the right of the line, and the elements immediately adjacent to the line are the metalloids.</p><p>Sodium in the Periodic Table. Sodium, atomic symbol Na, has an atomic number of eleven, and lies in group 1 on the periodic table, below lithium and to the left of magnesium.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
