      "number": 4,
      "question": "The reaction of an acid and a metal gives: &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2350;&#2381;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2366;&#2340;&#2369; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The reaction of an acid and a metal gives:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2350;&#2381;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2366;&#2340;&#2369; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Hydrogen gas and salt &#2361;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360; &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2350;&#2325;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Hydrogen gas and salt</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2361;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360; &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2350;&#2325;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Carbon dioxide, salt and water &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2344; &#2337;&#2366;&#2311;&#2321;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;, &#2344;&#2350;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Carbon dioxide, salt and water</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2344; &#2337;&#2366;&#2311;&#2321;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;, &#2344;&#2350;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Salt and water &#2344;&#2350;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Salt and water</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2350;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Carbon dioxide, salt and hydrogen gas &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2344; &#2337;&#2366;&#2311;&#2321;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;, &#2344;&#2350;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2361;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Carbon dioxide, salt and hydrogen gas</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2344; &#2337;&#2366;&#2311;&#2321;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;, &#2344;&#2350;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2361;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>&#183; When an acid reacts with a metal, the products are <b>salt and hydrogen gas</b>.</p><p>&#183; <b>General reaction:</b></p><p>Metal + Acid &rarr; Salt + Hydrogen gas</p><p>Example: Zn + HCl &rarr; ZnCl&#8322; + H&#8322;&#8593;</p>",
