      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following types of elements is included in the leftmost group of the periodic table?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2310;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2358;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Noble gases &#2344;&#2379;&#2348;&#2354; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Noble gases</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2379;&#2348;&#2354; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Halogen &#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Halogen</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Non metal &#2309;&#2343;&#2366;&#2340;&#2369;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Non metal</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2343;&#2366;&#2340;&#2369;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Alkali Metals &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368;&#2351; &#2343;&#2366;&#2340;&#2369;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Alkali Metals</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368;&#2351; &#2343;&#2366;&#2340;&#2369;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The group of elements that are on the far left of the periodic table are called the <b>alkali metals</b>, which have one electron in their outermost shell that they tend to lose easily.</p>",
