    {
      "id": "49e5d8b846a7-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "'Au' is the symbol for which of the following elements? 'Au' &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>'Au' is the symbol for which of the following elements?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">'Au' &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Gold &#2360;&#2379;&#2344;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Gold</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2379;&#2344;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Aluminium &#2309;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2350;&#2368;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Aluminium</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2350;&#2368;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Silver &#2330;&#2366;&#2305;&#2342;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Silver</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2366;&#2305;&#2342;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Argon &#2310;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Argon</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2310;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;&#2344;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The symbol <b>'Au'</b> represents <b>Gold</b>.</p><p>It comes from the Latin word <b>'Aurum'</b>, which means gold. Gold is a highly valued precious metal with the atomic number 79.</p>",
