      "question": "Which of the following is NOT a halogen gas? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following is NOT a halogen gas?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
      "options": [
